



DESCRIPTION
- Create a simple zap, linking a Gmail account to a Google Sheets document
-It checks incoming emails for the trigger word “Congratulations”
- If an email contains that word, the zap would extract the sender’s email address and store it in a Google Sheets document

OUTCOME
- It eliminates the need users to check for and sort important, relevant emails.
- It flags those emails and extracts the email of the sender, and stores it in a Google Sheet, for any further evaluation

















